{"3629200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Synthesis of Corruption", "steam_appid": 3629200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/410cc18316e42a5e577dec720acb8314.webp?t=1782492598\" width=600 height=57 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Atmospheric FPS-horror hybrid where human ambition meets primal terror.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/9afdf9d53a9d5cddad42264032e6398b.poster.avif?t=1782492598\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/9afdf9d53a9d5cddad42264032e6398b.webm?t=1782492598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/9afdf9d53a9d5cddad42264032e6398b.mp4?t=1782492598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person shooter with survival horror elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scientific horror atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low-poly graphics aesthetics reminiscent of late 90's games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanding on the story established in '<i>Snowsquall Grip</i>', '<i>Re.Surs</i>', and '<i>Plastomorphosis</i>'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">‎‎  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/ddb60d0de8bb7984d653690d3973f577.poster.avif?t=1782492598\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/ddb60d0de8bb7984d653690d3973f577.webm?t=1782492598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/ddb60d0de8bb7984d653690d3973f577.mp4?t=1782492598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the heart of Modern-City, the Continent's sprawling capital, an ominous discovery was made: dark energy particles accumulating at an unprecedented rate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Supreme One's Government immediately began construction of a classified laboratory complex within the imposing Nexus Tower. This colossal structure dominates the skyline, serving as both a governmental headquarters and a research facility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scientists studying the mysterious concentration proposed the &quot;<strong>Synthesis</strong>&quot; experiment <strong>–</strong> an ambitious attempt to isolate and manipulate a single dark particle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success would unlock the secrets of the Re.Surs, the unique dark energy that has permeated the entire Continent since the events documented in the &quot;Snowsquall Grip&quot; classified event.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But now this catastrophic failure threatens the future of not only Modern-City, but all life on the Continent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the assistant researcher arriving late to your shift, you alone must contain the corruption that scientists couldn't control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/7c0324e02aad2cd3f931ff1dcb26f1c0.poster.avif?t=1782492598\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/7c0324e02aad2cd3f931ff1dcb26f1c0.webm?t=1782492598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/7c0324e02aad2cd3f931ff1dcb26f1c0.mp4?t=1782492598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE GAME IS PART OF “RE.SURS UNIVERSE” GAME SERIES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SNOWSQUALL GRIP -&gt; SYNTHESIS OF CORRUPTION -&gt; RE.SURS -&gt; PLASTOMORPHOSIS</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/410cc18316e42a5e577dec720acb8314.webp?t=1782492598\" width=600 height=57 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Atmospheric FPS-horror hybrid where human ambition meets primal terror.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/9afdf9d53a9d5cddad42264032e6398b.poster.avif?t=1782492598\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/9afdf9d53a9d5cddad42264032e6398b.webm?t=1782492598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/9afdf9d53a9d5cddad42264032e6398b.mp4?t=1782492598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person shooter with survival horror elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scientific horror atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low-poly graphics aesthetics reminiscent of late 90's games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanding on the story established in '<i>Snowsquall Grip</i>', '<i>Re.Surs</i>', and '<i>Plastomorphosis</i>'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">‎‎  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/ddb60d0de8bb7984d653690d3973f577.poster.avif?t=1782492598\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/ddb60d0de8bb7984d653690d3973f577.webm?t=1782492598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/ddb60d0de8bb7984d653690d3973f577.mp4?t=1782492598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the heart of Modern-City, the Continent's sprawling capital, an ominous discovery was made: dark energy particles accumulating at an unprecedented rate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Supreme One's Government immediately began construction of a classified laboratory complex within the imposing Nexus Tower. This colossal structure dominates the skyline, serving as both a governmental headquarters and a research facility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scientists studying the mysterious concentration proposed the &quot;<strong>Synthesis</strong>&quot; experiment <strong>–</strong> an ambitious attempt to isolate and manipulate a single dark particle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success would unlock the secrets of the Re.Surs, the unique dark energy that has permeated the entire Continent since the events documented in the &quot;Snowsquall Grip&quot; classified event.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But now this catastrophic failure threatens the future of not only Modern-City, but all life on the Continent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the assistant researcher arriving late to your shift, you alone must contain the corruption that scientists couldn't control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/7c0324e02aad2cd3f931ff1dcb26f1c0.poster.avif?t=1782492598\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/7c0324e02aad2cd3f931ff1dcb26f1c0.webm?t=1782492598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/7c0324e02aad2cd3f931ff1dcb26f1c0.mp4?t=1782492598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE GAME IS PART OF “RE.SURS UNIVERSE” GAME SERIES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SNOWSQUALL GRIP -&gt; SYNTHESIS OF CORRUPTION -&gt; RE.SURS -&gt; PLASTOMORPHOSIS</strong></h2>", "short_description": "Emergency Protocol activated: Dark Energy Particle Synthesis failed. Now you – late and alone – must navigate a facility where science and sanity have collapsed. Face entities born from the corruption of dark energy in this atmospheric FPS-horror hybrid, where human ambition meets primal terror.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Portug